        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Babur</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1483 CE – 1530 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">14 February 1483 in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/andijan">Andijan</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fergana-valley">Fergana Valley</a>; eldest son of Umar Shaikh Mirza II, descended from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/timur">Timur</a> through his father and from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/genghis-khan">Genghis Khan</a> through his mother</span></div>
